      "instance_name": "group_of_men",
      "label": "group of men",
      "description": "A crowd of men, visually identifiable as Muslim men based on their attire (keffiyehs, headscarves), are depicted in an angry, aggressive pose. They are raising their hands, shouting, and displaying expressions of outrage or aggression. Their clothing includes traditional Middle Eastern garments such as keffiyehs and white headscarves (ghutras).",
