      "instance_name": "angry_men_protest",
      "label": "angry men protesting",
      "description": "A scene depicting a group of men, visually identifiable as Muslim men based on their attire (keffiyehs, headscarves), in an angry, aggressive pose. They are raising their hands, shouting, and displaying expressions of outrage or aggression. Their clothing includes traditional Middle Eastern garments such as keffiyehs and white headscarves (ghutras). The scene is framed to emphasize their collective anger and confrontation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
